        "remove_vertical_spacing": false,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "<section class=\"df-proof-section\">\n  <div class=\"df-proof-container\">\n\n    <div class=\"df-proof-header\">\n      <div class=\"df-proof-badge-row\">\n        <span class=\"df-proof-label\">EXCELLENT</span>\n\n        <div class=\"df-proof-stars\" aria-label=\"5 étoiles\">\n          <span>★</span>\n          <span>★</span>\n          <span>★</span>\n          <span>★</span>\n          <span>★</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"df-proof-subline\">\n        <span>noté <strong>4,8/5</strong> par nos clients</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2>Ils ont essayé. Ils ne peuvent plus s’en passer.</h2>\n      <p>\n        Moins de distractions, plus de concentration, une vraie routine de travail :\n        Déclic Focus s’est imposé dans leur quotidien.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"df-proof-grid\">\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_13_2.png?v=1788384315\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Sarah L.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Maman de 2 enfants</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Je l’utilise pour les devoirs de mes enfants et ça a tout changé. 25 minutes de concentration, 5 minutes de pause, et on recommence. Ils sont beaucoup plus réguliers et concentrés.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_13_4.png?v=1788384317\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Clara M.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Entrepreneure</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Ce minuteur m’a clairement aidée à arrêter de scroller entre deux tâches. Avant, je passais de WhatsApp à Instagram sans m’en rendre compte. Maintenant, je reste focus.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_00_1.png?v=1788384316\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Thomas R.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Étudiant</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>J’avais du mal à rester concentré plus de 15 minutes sans toucher mon téléphone. Avec le rythme 25/5, ma moyenne a commencé à remonter.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_13_3.png?v=1788384316\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Mehdi B.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Freelance</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Travailler seul de chez moi, c’était compliqué. Déclic Focus m’a remis un cadre : sessions de travail claires, vraies pauses et beaucoup moins de procrastination.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_01_5.png?v=1788384315\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Camille D.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Télétravail</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Depuis que je l’ai posé sur mon bureau, je travaille différemment. Il est super esthétique et il m’aide vraiment à rester concentrée sur une seule tâche.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_00_2.png?v=1788384315\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Julien P.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Entrepreneur e-commerce</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Avant, je lançais une tâche et 10 minutes après j’étais sur Pinterest ou Instagram. Maintenant je fais mes blocs de 25 minutes et j’avance vraiment.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_00_3.png?v=1788384315\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Inès T.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Étudiante en droit</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Les applis Pomodoro ne marchaient pas pour moi, parce que tout était sur mon téléphone. Là, je laisse mon portable loin et mes révisions sont beaucoup plus efficaces.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_14_9.png?v=1788384317\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Laura G.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Maman solo</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Entre le travail, les enfants et ma formation, je n’avais jamais de vrai temps pour étudier. Le minuteur m’aide à protéger des créneaux courts mais efficaces.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_15_10.png?v=1788384315\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Emma V.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Étudiante en médecine</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>En révision, c’est devenu indispensable. Je fais 4 cycles Pomodoro : 25 minutes de travail, 5 minutes de pause, et je tiens beaucoup plus longtemps.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_12_1.png?v=1788384315\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Nicolas A.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Consultant</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Ce que j’aime, c’est qu’il ne rajoute pas une application de plus. Je tourne le minuteur, je travaille, il sonne, je fais une pause. Simple et efficace.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_14_8.png?v=1788384315\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Amélie C.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Créatrice de contenu</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Je perdais énormément de temps à passer de Canva à Instagram puis à TikTok. Depuis Déclic Focus, je termine une tâche avant d’en commencer une autre.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_13_5.png?v=1788384315\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Karim S.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Dirigeant d’agence</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Il m’a aidé à retrouver du vrai travail profond. Pendant 25 minutes, plus de messages, plus de notifications, plus de scroll inutile.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_14_6.png?v=1788384316\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Sophie N.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Maman</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Mon fils avait beaucoup de mal à rester concentré sur ses devoirs. Avec le minuteur, il visualise le temps et se met au travail plus facilement.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_01_4.png?v=1788384315\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Maxime L.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Entrepreneur solo</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Je travaille seul, donc personne ne me cadre. Ce minuteur m’a permis de reprendre le contrôle de mes journées. En plus, il est beau sur le bureau.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"df-review-card\">\n        <div class=\"df-review-image-wrap\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_sept._2026_23_24_14_7.png?v=1788384316\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"df-review-content\">\n          <div class=\"df-review-top\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>Anaïs F.</h3>\n              <span class=\"df-review-role\">Télétravail</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"df-verified\">Vérifié</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>Je l’utilise tous les matins pour lancer ma première session. Mon téléphone reste loin, je suis plus calme, plus focus, et je termine enfin ma to-do list.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .df-proof-section {\n    padding: 72px 20px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: Inter, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .df-proof-container {\n    max-width: 1380px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .df-proof-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    margin: 0 auto 42px;\n  }\n\n  .df-proof-badge-row {\n   